{"strongs": "H6160", "word": "עֲרָבָה", "translit": "a.ra.vah", "root": "ערב", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "desert-plain, steppe", "definition": "I. עֲרָבָה 61 noun feminine desert-plain, steppe ; — absolute ׳ ע 2Sam 4:7 +, suffix עַרְבָתָהּ Isa 51:3 plural עֲרָבוֺת Jer 5:6 ; Ps 68:5 , construct עַרְבוֺת 2Kgs 25:5 +, עַרְבֹת Jer 52:8 — 1. earliest use: \\ \\ a. arid steppe west of Dead Sea (in southern Judah) 1Sam 23:24 , also Ezek 47:8 ; Isa 51:3 , whence name ׳ יָם הָע Josh 3:16 ( J E ) || יָם הַמֶּלַח ), also 2Kgs 14:25 ; Deut 4:49 , and (|| id .) Deut 3:17 ; Josh 12:3 ( D ); נַחַל הָעֲרָבָה Amos 6:14 must be east of Dead Sea, si vera lectio, but read probably מִצְרַיִם ׳ נ see נַחַל . \\ \\ b. Jordan-valley west of river + adjacent plain; near ford (opposite Jericho) 2Sam 2:29 , compare Josh 8:14 ( J E ); also Deut 11:30 ; 2Kgs 25:4 = Jer 39:4 = Jer 52:7 — 2Sam 15:28 ; 2Sam 17:16 see עֲבָרָה \\ \\ c. Jordan-valley east of river 2Sam 4:7 . 2. in D : \\ \\ a. especially of east Jordan plain Deut 1:1 (probably) Josh 12:1 ; Josh 12:3 , east half of Jordan-valley Deut 3:17 ; Deut 4:49 of entire Jordan-valley (between כִּנֶּרֶת and Dead Sea, modern El-Ghôr, the Depression ) Deut 1:7 ; Josh 11:2 ; Josh 11:16 west Jordan plain only Josh 12:8 depression south of Dead Sea (modern Wady el-`Arabah ) Deut 2:8 . 3. in P always plural construct עַרְבוֺת מוֺאָב (east Jordan) Num 22:1 + 11 t. (see מוֺאָב ); עְרֵחוֺ ׳ ע (West Jordan) Josh 4:13 ; Josh 5:10 , also 2Kgs 25:5 = Jer 39:5 = Jer 52:8 . 4. apparently North Arabian desert Isa 40:3 ; Isa 41:19 . 5. in general the steppe (often || מִדְבָּר ), Jer 17:6 ; Jer 50:12 ; Isa 33:9 ; Isa 35:1 ; Isa 35:6 ; Job 24:5 ; Job 39:6 ; Ps 68:5 זְאֵב עֲרָבוֺת Jer 5:6 (figurative of invader); compare description of Exodus אֶרֶץ עֲרָבָה וְשׁוּחָה Jer 2:6 in simile, of a plain , of future land of Judah Zech 14:10 . — See Dr Deut 1:1 and references Buhl Geogr. 111 . עַרְבָתִי see בֵּית הָעֲרָבָה", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6361')\">BDB6361</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6160')\">H6160</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6360')\">BDB6360</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6362')\">BDB6362</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>עֲרָבָה</bdbheb><sub>61</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>desert-plain, steppe</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,7)\">2Sam 4:7</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>עַרְבָתָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 51:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,3)\">Isa 51:3</ref> plural <bdbheb>עֲרָבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 5:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,6)\">Jer 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,5)\">Ps 68:5</ref>, construct <bdbheb>עַרְבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,5)\">2Kgs 25:5</ref> +, <bdbheb>עַרְבֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 52:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,8)\">Jer 52:8</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> earliest use: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> arid steppe west of Dead Sea (in southern Judah) <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,24)\">1Sam 23:24</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,8)\">Ezek 47:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 51:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,3)\">Isa 51:3</ref>, whence name <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָם הָע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 3:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,16)\">Josh 3:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) || <bdbheb>יָם הַמֶּלַח</bdbheb>), also <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,25)\">2Kgs 14:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:49\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,49)\">Deut 4:49</ref>, and (|| <highlight>id</highlight>.) <ref ref=\"Deut 3:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,17)\">Deut 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,3)\">Josh 12:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>נַחַל הָעֲרָבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 6:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,14)\">Amos 6:14</ref> must be east of Dead Sea, si vera lectio, but read probably <bdbheb>מִצְרַיִם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>נַחַל</reflink></bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> Jordan-valley west of river + adjacent plain; near ford (opposite Jericho) <ref ref=\"2Sam 2:29\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(10,2,29)\">2Sam 2:29</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Josh 8:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,14)\">Josh 8:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); also <ref ref=\"Deut 11:30\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,30)\">Deut 11:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,4)\">2Kgs 25:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 39:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,4)\">Jer 39:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,7)\">Jer 52:7</ref> — <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:28\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,28)\">2Sam 15:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,16)\">2Sam 17:16</ref> see  <bdbheb><reflink>עֲבָרָה</reflink></bdbheb> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> Jordan-valley east of river <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,7)\">2Sam 4:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> especially of east Jordan plain <ref ref=\"Deut 1:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,1)\">Deut 1:1</ref> (probably) <ref ref=\"Josh 12:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,1)\">Josh 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,3)\">Josh 12:3</ref>, east half of Jordan-valley <ref ref=\"Deut 3:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,17)\">Deut 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:49\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,49)\">Deut 4:49</ref> of entire Jordan-valley (between <bdbheb>כִּנֶּרֶת</bdbheb> and Dead Sea, modern <highlight>El-Ghôr, the Depression</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Deut 1:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,7)\">Deut 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:2\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,2)\">Josh 11:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,16)\">Josh 11:16</ref> west Jordan plain only <ref ref=\"Josh 12:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,8)\">Josh 12:8</ref> depression south of Dead Sea (modern <highlight>Wady el-`Arabah</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Deut 2:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,8)\">Deut 2:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> always plural construct <bdbheb>עַרְבוֺת מוֺאָב</bdbheb> (east Jordan) <ref ref=\"Num 22:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,1)\">Num 22:1</ref> + 11 t. (see  <bdbheb><reflink>מוֺאָב</reflink></bdbheb>); <bdbheb>עְרֵחוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> (West Jordan) <ref ref=\"Josh 4:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,13)\">Josh 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 5:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,10)\">Josh 5:10</ref>, also <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,5)\">2Kgs 25:5</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 39:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,5)\">Jer 39:5</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,8)\">Jer 52:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> apparently North Arabian desert <ref ref=\"Isa 40:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,3)\">Isa 40:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 41:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,19)\">Isa 41:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> in general <highlight>the steppe</highlight> (often || <bdbheb>מִדְבָּר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 17:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,6)\">Jer 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,12)\">Jer 50:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 33:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,9)\">Isa 33:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 35:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,1)\">Isa 35:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 35:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,6)\">Isa 35:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 24:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,5)\">Job 24:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 39:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,6)\">Job 39:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,5)\">Ps 68:5</ref> <bdbheb>זְאֵב עֲרָבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 5:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,6)\">Jer 5:6</ref> (figurative of invader); compare description of Exodus <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ עֲרָבָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>וְשׁוּחָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 2:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,6)\">Jer 2:6</ref> in simile, of a <highlight>plain</highlight>, of future land of Judah <ref ref=\"Zech 14:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,10)\">Zech 14:10</ref>. — See <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"Deut 1:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,1)\">Deut 1:1</ref> and references</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 111</sup></lookup>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>עַרְבָתִי</bdbheb> see <bdbheb>בֵּית הָעֲרָבָה</bdbheb> </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 4:7", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 4, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 51:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 51, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 5:6", "book": "JER", "chapter": 5, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ps 68:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 68, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Kgs 25:5", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 25, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer 52:8", "book": "JER", "chapter": 52, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Sam 23:24", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 